{"track":"sql","category":"윈도우 함수","level":4,"title":"과목 평균과의 차이","datasets":["exams"],"desc":"<p>각 시험 점수가 <b>그 과목 평균보다 얼마나 높거나 낮은지</b>(소수 둘째 자리 반올림)를 구하세요. 과목, 학생 번호 순서로 정렬합니다.</p><p>열: <code>student_id</code>, <code>subject</code>, <code>score</code>, <code>diff</code></p>","starter":"-- 여기에 쿼리를 작성하세요\n","ordered":true,"solution":"SELECT student_id, subject, score,\n       ROUND(score - AVG(score) OVER (PARTITION BY subject), 2) AS diff\nFROM exams\nORDER BY subject, student_id;","hint":"<p><code>AVG(score) OVER (PARTITION BY subject)</code> 는 그룹을 줄이지 않고 각 행 옆에 과목 평균을 붙여 줘요.</p>","id":"sql-085","expected":{"columns":["student_id","subject","score","diff"],"rows":[[1,"english",90,8.4],[2,"english",87,5.4],[3,"english",66,-15.6],[4,"english",95,13.4],[5,"english",61,-20.6],[6,"english",64,-17.6],[7,"english",99,17.4],[8,"english",93,11.4],[9,"english",96,14.4],[10,"english",65,-16.6],[1,"math",83,4.7],[2,"math",83,4.7],[3,"math",67,-11.3],[4,"math",85,6.7],[5,"math",66,-12.3],[6,"math",74,-4.3],[7,"math",89,10.7],[8,"math",57,-21.3],[9,"math",83,4.7],[10,"math",96,17.7],[1,"science",84,-2.3],[2,"science",92,5.7],[3,"science",87,0.7],[4,"science",94,7.7],[5,"science",83,-3.3],[6,"science",60,-26.3],[7,"science",95,8.7],[8,"science",80,-6.3],[9,"science",94,7.7],[10,"science",94,7.7]]}}